 "<h2>🗺️ День</h2>{0}\n      <button class=\"big\" id=\"sdAll\">🎮 Все игры</button>\n      <label class=\"sw\" for=\"sdOn\"><input id=\"sdOn\" type=\"checkbox\" {1}><span class=\"set-t\"><b>Простой день</b><small>тропа и двери дня; если выключить — у ребёнка снова все вкладки</small></span></label>\n      <h3 class=\"fam-s\">Обязательно каждый день</h3>\n      <p class=\"sd-note\">Обязательное идёт по тропе по порядку. Остальное — «по желанию», после сундука.</p>\n      <div class=\"sd-must\">{2}</div>\n      <h3 class=\"fam-s\">Двери дня</h3>\n      <p class=\"sd-note\">Каждый день открыто «Моё любимое» ребёнка ({3}) и одна дверь-сюрприз.</p>\n      <select id=\"sdWeek\" class=\"sd-sel\"><option value=\"\">⭐ Тема недели — нет</option>{4}</select>\n      <p class=\"sd-note\">Сегодня: {5}</p>\n      <div class=\"sd-areas\" id=\"sdAreas\">{6}</div>\n      <p class=\"sd-note\">Выключенная тема не приходит в двери. Открыть дверь сегодня:</p>\n      <select id=\"sdAdd\" class=\"sd-sel\"><option value=\"\">— выбрать —</option>{7}</select>\n      <h3 class=\"fam-s\">Любимая игра</h3>\n      <div class=\"sd-seg\" id=\"sdFavM\">{8}</div>\n      <select id=\"sdFavG\" class=\"sd-sel\"><option value=\"\">сама: {9}</option>{10}</select>\n      <div id=\"dgPar\">{11}</div>\n      <div id=\"wiPar\">{12}</div>": [
  "<h2>🗺️ Day</h2>{0}\n      <button class=\"big\" id=\"sdAll\">🎮 All games</button>\n      <label class=\"sw\" for=\"sdOn\"><input id=\"sdOn\" type=\"checkbox\" {1}><span class=\"set-t\"><b>Simple day</b><small>the path and the doors of the day; if you turn it off, the child gets all the tabs again</small></span></label>\n      <h3 class=\"fam-s\">Every day, a must</h3>\n      <p class=\"sd-note\">The must-dos go along the path in order. Everything else is \"if you like\", after the chest.</p>\n      <div class=\"sd-must\">{2}</div>\n      <h3 class=\"fam-s\">Doors of the day</h3>\n      <p class=\"sd-note\">Every day the child's \"My favourites\" ({3}) are open, plus one surprise door.</p>\n      <select id=\"sdWeek\" class=\"sd-sel\"><option value=\"\">⭐ Theme of the week — none</option>{4}</select>\n      <p class=\"sd-note\">Today: {5}</p>\n      <div class=\"sd-areas\" id=\"sdAreas\">{6}</div>\n      <p class=\"sd-note\">A theme that is turned off does not come to the doors. Open a door today:</p>\n      <select id=\"sdAdd\" class=\"sd-sel\"><option value=\"\">— choose —</option>{7}</select>\n      <h3 class=\"fam-s\">Favourite game</h3>\n      <div class=\"sd-seg\" id=\"sdFavM\">{8}</div>\n      <select id=\"sdFavG\" class=\"sd-sel\"><option value=\"\">on my own: {9}</option>{10}</select>\n      <div id=\"dgPar\">{11}</div>\n      <div id=\"wiPar\">{12}</div>",
  "<h2>🗺️ Dia</h2>{0}\n      <button class=\"big\" id=\"sdAll\">🎮 Todos os jogos</button>\n      <label class=\"sw\" for=\"sdOn\"><input id=\"sdOn\" type=\"checkbox\" {1}><span class=\"set-t\"><b>Dia simples</b><small>o trilho e as portas do dia; se desligares, a criança volta a ter todos os separadores</small></span></label>\n      <h3 class=\"fam-s\">Obrigatório todos os dias</h3>\n      <p class=\"sd-note\">O obrigatório segue pelo trilho, por ordem. O resto é \"se quiseres\", depois do baú.</p>\n      <div class=\"sd-must\">{2}</div>\n      <h3 class=\"fam-s\">Portas do dia</h3>\n      <p class=\"sd-note\">Todos os dias estão abertos os \"Preferidos\" da criança ({3}) e uma porta-surpresa.</p>\n      <select id=\"sdWeek\" class=\"sd-sel\"><option value=\"\">⭐ Tema da semana — nenhum</option>{4}</select>\n      <p class=\"sd-note\">Hoje: {5}</p>\n      <div class=\"sd-areas\" id=\"sdAreas\">{6}</div>\n      <p class=\"sd-note\">Um tema desligado não aparece nas portas. Abrir uma porta hoje:</p>\n      <select id=\"sdAdd\" class=\"sd-sel\"><option value=\"\">— escolher —</option>{7}</select>\n      <h3 class=\"fam-s\">Jogo preferido</h3>\n      <div class=\"sd-seg\" id=\"sdFavM\">{8}</div>\n      <select id=\"sdFavG\" class=\"sd-sel\"><option value=\"\">sozinha: {9}</option>{10}</select>\n      <div id=\"dgPar\">{11}</div>\n      <div id=\"wiPar\">{12}</div>",
  "<h2>🗺️ Tag</h2>{0}\n      <button class=\"big\" id=\"sdAll\">🎮 Alle Spiele</button>\n      <label class=\"sw\" for=\"sdOn\"><input id=\"sdOn\" type=\"checkbox\" {1}><span class=\"set-t\"><b>Einfacher Tag</b><small>Pfad und Türen des Tages; wenn du es ausschaltest, hat das Kind wieder alle Reiter</small></span></label>\n      <h3 class=\"fam-s\">Jeden Tag Pflicht</h3>\n      <p class=\"sd-note\">Die Pflichtsachen kommen der Reihe nach auf dem Pfad. Alles andere ist „wenn du magst“, nach der Truhe.</p>\n      <div class=\"sd-must\">{2}</div>\n      <h3 class=\"fam-s\">Türen des Tages</h3>\n      <p class=\"sd-note\">Jeden Tag ist „Mein Liebstes“ des Kindes offen ({3}) und eine Überraschungstür.</p>\n      <select id=\"sdWeek\" class=\"sd-sel\"><option value=\"\">⭐ Thema der Woche — keins</option>{4}</select>\n      <p class=\"sd-note\">Heute: {5}</p>\n      <div class=\"sd-areas\" id=\"sdAreas\">{6}</div>\n      <p class=\"sd-note\">Ein ausgeschaltetes Thema kommt nicht in die Türen. Heute eine Tür öffnen:</p>\n      <select id=\"sdAdd\" class=\"sd-sel\"><option value=\"\">— wählen —</option>{7}</select>\n      <h3 class=\"fam-s\">Lieblingsspiel</h3>\n      <div class=\"sd-seg\" id=\"sdFavM\">{8}</div>\n      <select id=\"sdFavG\" class=\"sd-sel\"><option value=\"\">selbst: {9}</option>{10}</select>\n      <div id=\"dgPar\">{11}</div>\n      <div id=\"wiPar\">{12}</div>"
 ],
